# Custom Stock Portfolio Feature

Allow users to hand-pick individual stocks (beyond strategy-recommended ones) and create custom portfolios that get the full suite of platform features — backtest, playbook, drift monitoring, rebalance, and alerts.

## Architecture Summary

The core design insight: **a custom portfolio is just a strategy with `strategy_type = "custom"`** and its stock list stored in `rules_json` instead of filter/ranking rules. This means we can reuse ~90% of the existing infrastructure (backtest, playbook, drift monitor, rebalance, alerts) with targeted modifications.

