## What Already Works Without Changes

These features will work automatically for custom portfolios because they operate on the **strategy's resolved stock list**, not on its rules:

- ✅ **AI Playbook** — Generates entry/exit zones, ATR stops, and targets from price data
- ✅ **Drift Monitor** — Tracks weight drift from target allocations
- ✅ **Rebalance Engine** — Calculates buy/sell orders to restore target weights
- ✅ **Alerts** — Thesis break alerts work on any stock in a strategy
- ✅ **Portfolio Optimization** — MVO/Risk Parity works on any stock list

